The bundle below does not compile, on purpose.

`partition` is a name the bundle keeps and Data.List also exports, and
Sorted's open import is in scope for the whole merged module, so the use
in the user's code is an ambiguous occurrence.

The bundler does not hide kept names from open imports: the lists ran to
tens of kilobytes on a real library, nearly all of it names the module
never exported. GHC reports the clash exactly, and `--rename-cmd` moves
the name out of the way.
